1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:01,870
Every night, your brain begins

2
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:04,050
a remarkable transformation.

3
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:06,570
As you fall asleep, its activity changes

4
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:09,250
in carefully coordinated stages.

5
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:11,530
During NREM sleep, brain activity

6
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:13,691
shifts through different patterns.

7
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:17,130
During REM sleep, brain activity

8
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,640
becomes more wake-like,

9
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,300
and vivid dreams are especially common.

10
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:22,980
Meanwhile, sleep helps your brain

11
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:25,627
process memories and support learning.

12
00:00:25,990 --> 00:00:26,950
And that's only part of

13
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,866
what happens while you sleep.
